ind":"announcement","title":"Zumbi Olé Demo V2 Is Out Now!","summary":"The Zumbi Olé Demo V2 is much more than a patch. It’s loaded with enough new features to make any zombie rot with envy! For starters, dribbling is now much more fun, responsive, and under your control. Kicks and dashes now deal damage, and the good old Vending Machines finally take coins, turning every in-game gear purchase into a strategic choice. The entire experience, from the Main Menu to your final dribble before sunrise, has been refined to keep the focus where it belongs: reading the hord","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-19T19:04:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228663551","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4230740-1832065502810133","game_id":"steam-4230740","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v1.2.0 is live!","summary":"A new update is live!More zombies. Better olés. Fewer apocalypse bugs.Hey Olézers!We just released a new update for the Zumbi Olé demo!This patch improves the game feel, makes the Courtyard arena more chaotic, adds new player damage feedback, improves the tutorial flow, and fixes a bunch of annoying bugs reported during the demo. The apocalypse is still ridiculous. It just works better now!HighlightsMore zombie chaos in the Courtyard We adjusted the Courtyard intensity range so more zombies can ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-06T19:53:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502810133","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4230740-1831432155566155","game_id":"steam-4230740","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.1 Available","summary":"Demo 1.1 Available Boludo Zombie has a new skin! The Zumbi Olé demo is already getting its first update!We listened to the community’s feedback, adjusted a few important details, and even gave Boludo Zombie a fresh new look. You know, that little maniac who runs around with a ball on his head. He was already on the field, but now he’s stepping in with a brand-new skin!Change Log - Demo 1.1New texture for Boludo ZombieUI fix for 16:10 aspect ratio screensAdjusted the initial popup position in the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-29T19:50:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155566155","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4230740-1830797770243899","game_id":"steam-4230740","kind":"announcement","title":"Zumbi Olé demo is here!","summary":"The wait is over! You can now play the Zumbi Olé demo!Step into the arena, face hordes of goofy zombies, and survive until sunrise using dribbles, powerful kicks, and perfectly timed dashes.If you enjoy skill-based arcade games, survival score-chasers, and intense gameplay, Zumbi Olé is for you!In the demo, you will:dribble through insane zombie hordesclear space with powerful kicksescape pressure using dashesuse items to improve your chances in the arenachase the highest score possibleprove you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-28T00:47:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770243899","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4230740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:58Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:58Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4230740":"2026-10-26T11:45:58Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4230740":{"last_attempt